Package: erhai-mesa
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Erwin <yzddmr7@gmail.com>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: Freedreno OpenGL desktop driver for the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro
 Private Mesa libraries with the upstream Adreno 830v1 device entry and a
 fix for texture state mix-ups between threads of one GL context.
 GNOME and systemd user sessions select this driver at their next start
 while the GPU is bound to its kernel driver, and Ubuntu's software renderer
 otherwise; distribution libraries remain owned and updated by Ubuntu.
 Includes desktop OpenGL and GLES. Vulkan is not enabled. Removing this
 package restores distribution driver selection at the next session start.
